ilences you","reason_zh":"沉默使用者属于自身代价，按规则不计沉默机制。"},{"mechanism":"slow_resistance","condition":"item","decision":"accept","condition_correct":true,"correct_condition":"item","quote":"%berserk_slow_resist%%%/%berserk_slow_resist_melee%%% slow resistance (ranged/melee)","reason_zh":"主动效果明确赋予使用者减速抗性。"}]},{"subject":"mekansm","judgments":[{"mechanism":"aura","condition":"item","decision":"accept","condition_correct":true,"correct_condition":"item","quote":"Passive: Mekansm Aura Grants %aura_health_regen% health regeneration to allied units in a %aura_radius% radius.","reason_zh":"装备的被动光环持续向周围友军提供生命恢复。"},{"mechanism":"healing","condition":"item","decision":"accept","condition_correct":true,"correct_condition":"item","quote":"Restores %heal_amount% health to allied units in a %heal_radius% radius.","reason_zh":"主动效果直接恢复范围内友军生命值。"},{"mechanism":"healing","condition":"item","decision":"accept","condition_correct":true,"correct_condition":"item","quote":"Grants %aura_health_regen% health regeneration to allied units in a %aura_radius% radius.","reason_zh":"被动效果为周围友军提供生命恢复。"}]},{"subject":"meteor_hammer","judgments":[{"mechanism":"aoe_damage","condition":"item","decision":"accept","condition_correct":true,"correct_condition":"item","quote":"strikes a %impact_radius% AoE, stunning enemies for %stun_duration% seconds and dealing impact damage","reason_zh":"一次施放在范围内对多个敌人造成冲击伤害。"},{"mechanism":"slow","condition":"item","decision":"accept","condition_correct":true,"correct_condition":"item","quote":"Non-building units are also slowed for %burn_slow%%% for the duration of the burn.","reason_zh":"燃烧期间明确减速非建筑单位。"},{"mechanism":"spell_amp","condition":"item","decision":"accept","condition_correct":true,"correct_condition":"item","quote":"+ 10% Spell Amplification","reason_zh":"装备属性明确提供法术放大。"},{"mechanism":"stun","condition":"item","decision":"accept","condition_correct":true,"correct_condition":"item","quote":"stunning enemies for %stun_duration% seconds","reason_zh":"陨石命中明确使敌人眩晕。"}]},